 "text": "# Navbar\n\nType: Bootstrap drop-in. Write standard Bootstrap 5.3.8 markup. The kit only changes the look; no new classes are needed.\nSection: Componentes\nHuman version (rendered examples): componentes/navbar.html\nProse language: Brazilian Portuguese. Code, class names and identifier tables are language-neutral.\n\nBarras de navegação. Os nav-link e o toggler são botões do kit; marca e collapse seguem o Bootstrap.\n\n```\n<nav class=\"navbar navbar-expand-md\">\n  <div class=\"container-fluid\">\n    <a class=\"navbar-brand\" href=\"#\">C-RO</a>\n    <button\n      class=\"navbar-toggler\"\n      type=\"button\"\n      data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n      data-bs-target=\"#nvEx\"\n      aria-controls=\"nvEx\"\n      aria-expanded=\"false\"\n      aria-label=\"Alternar navegação\">\n      <span class=\"navbar-toggler-icon\"></span>\n    </button>\n    <div class=\"collapse navbar-collapse\" id=\"nvEx\">\n      <ul class=\"navbar-nav me-auto\">\n        <li class=\"nav-item\">\n          <a class=\"nav-link active\" aria-current=\"page\" href=\"#\">Início</a>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#\">Itens</a></li>\n        <li class=\"nav-item\">\n          <a class=\"nav-link disabled\" aria-disabled=\"true\">Desabilitado</a>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n      <form class=\"d-flex\" role=\"search\">\n        <input\n          class=\"form-control form-control-sm me-2\"\n          type=\"search\"\n          placeholder=\"Buscar\"\n          aria-label=\"Buscar\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\" type=\"submit\">Ir</button>\n      </form>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</nav>\n```\n\n## Com dropdown\n\n```\n<nav class=\"navbar navbar-expand\">\n  <div class=\"container-fluid\">\n    <a class=\"navbar-brand\" href=\"#\">Menu</a>\n    <ul class=\"navbar-nav\">\n      <li class=\"nav-item dropdown\">\n        <a\n          class=\"nav-link dropdown-toggle\"\n          href=\"#\"\n          data-bs-toggle=\"dropdown\"\n          aria-expanded=\"false\">\n          Conta\n        </a>\n        <ul class=\"dropdown-menu\">\n          <li><a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"#\">Perfil</a></li>\n          <li><a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"#\">Sair</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n</nav>\n```\n\nNote\n\nEsta própria documentação usa uma navbar do kit no topo da página.\n\n## Variações\n\n```\n<nav class=\"navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-dark bg-dark mb-2\">\n  <div class=\"container-fluid\">\n    <a class=\"navbar-brand\" href=\"#\">navbar-dark</a>\n    <span class=\"navbar-text\">navbar-text</span>\n  </div>\n</nav>\n```\n\n- Expansão responsiva: navbar-expand-sm, -md, -lg, -xl, -xxl (ou navbar-expand sempre expandida).\n- Texto: navbar-text para texto sem link.\n- Rolagem: navbar-nav-scroll limita a altura do menu aberto.\n- Escura: navbar-dark (com bg-dark) usa a superfície escura do Bootstrap.\n\nExpansão: navbar-expand-sm|md|lg|xl|xxl. Offcanvas responsivo: offcanvas-sm|md|lg|xl|xxl.\n« Modal · Navs e abas »\n",
